 ## Codebase Patterns
+- Production operations commands that mutate control-plane source-of-truth
+  state should be pinned by release static tests and route writes through a
+  narrow `yalla-api` maintenance flag rather than shell SQL; keep the script,
+  `deploy/operations` runbook, SECURITY.md gate row, CI step,
+  `scripts/verify.sh`, and `internal/release/*_static_test.go` in lockstep,
+  with dry-run output redacting `YALLA_*` values.
